~ intro
do play_and_wait("small_worker_enter")
do play("small_worker_idle")
small_worker: Jeez, that guy
small_worker: Hello
small_worker: I will have a small coffee
=> END!

~ large_coffee
=>< small_cups
small_worker: Or I can share this large coffee with three people.
small_worker: Yeah, imma do that
=> goodbye

~ medium_coffee
=>< small_cups
=> goodbye

~ small_cups
small_worker: Oh yeah I remember, they stopped making small cups.
small_worker: Not because of ecology or anything. [#anim=idle]
small_worker: Because people who drink small amounts of coffee won't achieve big things here.
small_worker: Now, we just drink half of the medium cup.
=> END

~ goodbye
small_worker: Oh and [#anim=idle]
small_worker: Maybe you should not shoot full coffee cups?
small_worker: Kinda dangerous.
small_worker: Anyways...
small_worker: Thank you!
do play_and_wait("small_worker_leave")
=> END!

~ duck
small_worker: Oh nice
=> END!

~ compass
small_worker: I dont know about that
small_worker: I get your point though
=> END!

~ wrong_item
small_worker: What the heck is this
=> END!
